Title: Test Fixture for the 'zurand' C API
Description: Built by tests/testthat/test-c-api.R to exercise the 'zurand'
    C API the way a downstream package would. A real package declares
    'LinkingTo: zurand' and 'Imports: zurand'; this fixture gets the header
    path from the test instead, so it also builds under devtools::test().
